// Title: Guest Account Enabled Via Sysadminctl
// ID: d7329412-13bd-44ba-a072-3387f804a106
// Status: test
// Level: low
// Author: Sohan G (D4rkCiph3r)
// Date: 2023-02-18
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.initial-access, attack.stealth, attack.t1078, attack.t1078.001
// Description: Detects attempts to enable the guest account using the sysadminctl utility
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(Image ENDSWITH "/sysadminctl" AND (CommandLine CONTAINS " -guestAccount" AND CommandLine CONTAINS " on"))
